      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Effects of COVID-19 Mental Health Interventions Among Children, Adolescents, and Adults Not Quarantined or Undergoing Treatment Due to COVID-19 Infection: A Systematic Review of Randomised Controlled Trials",
      "reason": "The title specifies the population ('Children, Adolescents, and Adults Not Quarantined or Undergoing Treatment Due to COVID-19 Infection') and the intervention focus ('COVID-19 Mental Health Interventions'), providing key information about the review question."
    },
